          How to Remove <span class="text-[#38BDF8]">Old Driveway Sealer</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Peeling, flaking, alligatored sealer is buildup, and coating over it just adds another layer to the pile. Here is how to get it off without destroying the asphalt underneath.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a
